Z||000000||nivlek68||08-18-2000||02:39 PM||||does anyone know if the 86 fiero sc efi is actally efi and not tbi. the vin # says efi and i have a tbi just wondering.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Pontiaddict||08-18-2000||03:06 PM||||TBI is EFI<BR>EFI = Electronic Fuel Injection<BR>TBI = Throttle Body Injection<P>TBI is computer controlled fuel injection, which is EFI.<P>The 2 main differences in EFI are Throttle Body Injection, where the fuel injector is in the throttle body, right above the throttle blades, And Multi port injection, where the injectors are in each intake runner, right before the valves.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula||08-18-2000||08:01 PM||||EFI on fieros actually stands for Electromagnetic Fudge Intake<P>as you drive down the road have you ever noticed that fudge just comes from nowhere and into your mouth.  Well, folks, this is a common option on all pontiac cars from the 80s.  there is a way to bypass this and it is quite easy, for the V6 models you have to find the grey fudge maker that is on the intake tube, pry this out with a screw driver and you should be set to go. On the 4-cyl. model its more difficult, you have to lift the "fudge cleaner" off then pry with 2 screw drivers at an equal distance from the gravitational field of the north pole.  If done correctly, the car wont start because you cut off the bypass security valve by removing the actual fudge element, to correct this you have to go to a place called edelbrock and ask for a thing called a carberautor, they will give you all of the proper installion techinique guides and even give you a nifty key ring to boot.  I can make a complete E-mail guide if someone wants one.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>somebody is a litle bit bored today huh...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formula_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||nivlek68||08-18-2000||10:58 PM||||pontaddict thanks, i knew what tbi was and efi. i figured pontiac should have put tbi in vin # instead of efi because that leaves alot of options out there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR> formula yea way to much time on hand lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
